    {
      "gameKey": "quest/042/AktKzf019_04274#TEXT_AKTKZF019_04274_VISHRAHD_000_001",
      "en": "You must be the substitute hamsa-keeper. Well, you're late! Feeding time was supposed to start bells ago! And a hungry hamsa is a noisy hamsa, as you can hear for yourself.",
      "hash": "246F753995A156D5",
      "unresolved": false,
      "fr": "C'est toi l<if(gnum4,a,e)> soigneu<if(gnum4,se,r)> remplaçant<if(gnum4,e,)><nbsp>? Tu es en retard<nbsp>! Dépêche-toi, il faut nourrir les hamsa<nbsp>!",
      "ja": "おう、臨時雇用の飼育員ってのは、お前さんだな？<br>遅かったじゃないか、<br>さっそく、ハンサの餌やりを手伝ってもらうぞ。",
      "frMacro": "C'est toi l<if(gnum4,a,e)> soigneu<if(gnum4,se,r)> remplaçant<if(gnum4,e,)><nbsp>? Tu es en retard<nbsp>! Dépêche-toi, il faut nourrir les hamsa<nbsp>!",
      "jaMacro": "おう、臨時雇用の飼育員ってのは、お前さんだな？<br>遅かったじゃないか、<br>さっそく、ハンサの餌やりを手伝ってもらうぞ。",
      "conversation": "quest/042/AktKzf019_04274",
      "seq": 3,
      "speaker": "VISHRAHD",
      "speakerKind": "character",
      "speakerGender": "male",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "questId": "AktKzf019_04274",
