    {
      "gameKey": "quest/042/AktKzf019_04274#TEXT_AKTKZF019_04274_VISHRAHD_000_003",
      "en": "Here you go─one large feed bag, and one small. Hamsa of different stature have different diets, you see. And they're finicky eaters, to boot.",
      "hash": "25ECE9300F18AF51",
      "unresolved": false,
      "fr": "Je te préviens, nos mignons petits hamsa ont des goûts différents.",
      "ja": "いいか、ハンサは体格ごとに好む餌が違う。<br>間違えると食ってくれないから、ちゃんと見極めるんだ。<br>ほれ、これが餌袋……小柄用と大柄用、1つずつな。",
      "jaMacro": "いいか、ハンサは体格ごとに好む餌が違う。<br>間違えると食ってくれないから、ちゃんと見極めるんだ。<br>ほれ、これが餌袋……小柄用と大柄用、1つずつな。",
      "conversation": "quest/042/AktKzf019_04274",
      "seq": 5,
      "speaker": "VISHRAHD",
      "speakerKind": "character",
      "speakerGender": "male",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "questId": "AktKzf019_04274",
      "questName": "Hungry Hungry Hamsa",
      "section": "Sidequests",
      "category": "Thavnairian Sidequests",
      "genre": "Radz-at-Han Sidequests",
      "previousQuest": "AktKmd110_04418",
