      "questLevel": 80,
      "questRowId": 69810,
      "expansion": "Endwalker",
      "eventIconType": 1
    },
    {
      "gameKey": "quest/042/AktKzf019_04274#TEXT_AKTKZF019_04274_VISHRAHD_000_004",
      "en": "The smaller ones require only a simple mix of greens and grains. But our big boys also need a helping of silkworm pupae for extra protein. The foodstuffs are next to that wooden crate over there. Now get to it!",
      "hash": "ADE109A56A8382BC",
      "unresolved": false,
      "fr": "Le petit aime les légumes et les graines. Le gros a le même régime alimentaire, mais on lui donne aussi des vers à soie. Leur nourriture est posée à côté des caisses en bois.",
      "ja": "小柄なハンサには「野菜」と「穀物」。<br>大柄なハンサは「野菜」と「穀物」と「カイコ」を与えるんだ。<br>餌は木箱の横にあるから……頼んだぞ！",
      "jaMacro": "小柄なハンサには「野菜」と「穀物」。<br>大柄なハンサは「野菜」と「穀物」と「カイコ」を与えるんだ。<br>餌は木箱の横にあるから……頼んだぞ！",
      "conversation": "quest/042/AktKzf019_04274",
      "seq": 6,
      "speaker": "VISHRAHD",
      "speakerKind": "character",
      "speakerGender": "male",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "questId": "AktKzf019_04274",
